WEBVTT

00:32.399 --> 00:35.781
Four empty spaces in the room

00:39.403 --> 00:42.804
A silent echo in the gloom

00:45.806 --> 00:52.629
We crossed the way to find a shore But left behind

00:54.170 --> 00:55.731
what came before

00:59.502 --> 01:05.224
The city lights are cold and bright A different

01:05.284 --> 01:11.026
sky A different night

01:12.566 --> 01:16.148
Standing in the hollow square

01:19.009 --> 01:25.523
Reaching out but no one's there We forged the

01:25.643 --> 01:30.465
ember, paint the sky To keep the fading embers

01:33.345 --> 01:48.949
high In the hollow square

01:49.869 --> 01:53.210
The cables hung, the circuits clogged

01:56.559 --> 01:59.721
To mask the quiet down below

02:03.244 --> 02:08.828
We sequence notes to fill the void A symphony

02:11.470 --> 02:13.031
we re-employ

02:16.474 --> 02:23.019
Just to remain, to hold the line And reconstruct

02:25.058 --> 02:29.299
The grand design

02:29.319 --> 02:33.000
Standing in the hollow square

02:36.161 --> 02:41.883
Reaching out but no one's there Reforge the

