armor, paint the sky To keep the fading embers

02:47.644 --> 02:50.745
high

02:51.665 --> 02:53.326
In the hollow square

03:00.144 --> 03:06.886
The stage is smaller But the sound is deep A

03:06.966 --> 03:11.667
promise that we swore to keep

03:13.568 --> 03:21.050
Through the silence Hear the spark we light The

03:21.110 --> 03:24.331
beacons in the dark

03:52.503 --> 03:56.204
Standing in the hollow square

